    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The street is your restaurant. You\u2019ll have to be fast to win!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food Cart, Inc.</strong> is a fast food management simulation where you take your mobile food cart and chase fame across the big city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From downtown streets to carnival zones, from university campuses to busy airports \u2014 set up your cart, collect orders, prep your ingredients, and most importantly\u2026 don\u2019t keep the customers waiting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710900/extras/73dda59c1419d4f1d22183a4089018e1.avif?t=1754548677\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Real-time cooking</strong><br>Chop ingredients, grill meat, fry potatoes, and deliver the order right on time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Expanding city map</strong><br>Serve in city centers, beaches, carnivals, stadiums, universities and more \u2014 each with unique customer types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Revenue management</strong><br>Earn money, manage your ingredient stock, and purchase licenses to unlock new districts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Mastery system</strong><br>The more you cook specific dishes, the better you become. Mastery increases tips and builds your fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Rising challenge</strong><br>Expect more customers, more complex orders, and tighter time limits as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Goal-oriented progression</strong><br>Each region unlocks with new missions and achievements to conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710900/extras/021ecc0a685dca22534f717a488d5034.avif?t=1754548677\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food Cart, Inc.</strong> is both a time-management game that challenges your reflexes, and a strategy game that rewards smart planning.<br>With vibrant visuals, themed zones, and fluid mechanics, it\u2019s as fun as it is satisfying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are the meals ready? Your next customer has just arrived.<br><br>See You at the Cart!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you like <strong>Food Cart, Inc.</strong>, don\u2019t forget to add it to your <strong>Steam Wishlist</strong> to be notified when the full version launches!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The street is your restaurant. You\u2019ll have to be fast to win!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Food Cart, Inc.</strong> is a fast food management simulation where you take your mobile food cart and chase fame across the big city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From downtown streets to carnival zones, from university campuses to busy airports \u2014 set up your cart, collect orders, prep your ingredients, and most importantly\u2026 don\u2019t keep the customers waiting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710900/extras/73dda59c1419d4f1d22183a4089018e1.avif?t=1754548677\" data-has-big width=800 height=256 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Real-time cooking</strong><br>Chop ingredients, grill meat, fry potatoes, and deliver the order right on time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Expanding city map</strong><br>Serve in city centers, beaches, carnivals, stadiums, universities and more \u2014 each with unique customer types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Revenue management</strong><br>Earn money, manage your ingredient stock, and purchase licenses to unlock new districts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Mastery system</strong><br>The more you cook specific dishes, the better you become. Mastery increases tips and builds your fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Rising challenge</strong><br>Expect more customers, more complex orders, and tighter time limits as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Goal-oriented progression</strong><br>Each region unlocks with new missions and achievements to conquer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710900/extras/021ecc0a